// exe::Name.get() / .fn<F>() / .is(v), hk::Call<F>(exe::Name, ...), Mem<T>(exe::Name[, offset]),
// hk::Detour(exe::Name, hook, stolen, feature). Each module part resolves the table once at startup
// (exe::ResolveAll); an unresolved symbol fails closed.
